{
  "name": "Gemma4-26B-A4B",
  "repos": [
    "google/gemma-4-26B-A4B-it"
  ],
  "note": "A global layer every sixth (5, 11, 17, 23, 29), as config.json's layer_types states them and the GGUF's sliding_window_pattern implies. Gemma 4's released weights carry a vision tower the runtime does not serve.",
